ST coverage commonly includes federation statements though the provided ST snippets do not explicitly show this exact quote — treated as partial support.\",\"importance\":\"minor\",\"status\":\"weak\",\"claim_key\":\"ae922c2c5aa7\",\"draft_sentence\":\"The Moroccan football federation said in a statement that its appeal “was never intended to contest the sporting performance of the teams participating in this competition, but solely to request the application of the competition regulations”.\",\"sentence_key\":\"ea88f2f726c7\",\"sentence_index\":6}],\"claim_summary\":{\"supported\":4,\"weak\":2,\"contradicted\":0,\"total\":6},\"matched_sources\":[{\"name\":\"ST\",\"title\":\"Senegal to appeal after being stripped of Afcon title, hosts Morocco declared champions\",\"url\":\"https://www.straitstimes.com/sport/football/morocco-declared-africa-cup-of-nations-champions-after-caf-strips-senegal-of-title\",\"match_type\":\"direct\",\"relevance_note\":\"Directly supports the draft\'s core claims: March 17 CAF decision, Senegal to appeal, and that the walk-off occurred during the Jan 18 final.\",\"snippet\":\"PARIS – Senegal have said they will appeal after they were sensationally stripped of the Africa Cup of Nations (Afcon) title on March 17 and the Confederation of African Football (CAF) instead declared Morocco as champions, two months after their chaotic final in Rabat.\",\"source_type\":\"article\"},{\"name\":\"ST\",\"title\":\"Senegal to protest being stripped of Cup of Nations title\",\"url\":\"https://www.straitstimes.com/sport/football/senegal-to-protest-being-stripped-of-cup-of-nations-title\",\"match_type\":\"direct\",\"relevance_note\":\"Directly corroborates that CAF awarded a 3-0 result to Morocco and reports Senegal’s condemnation and intent to challenge the decision.\",\"snippet\":\"CAPE TOWN, March 18 - Senegal have condemned the decision to strip them of the Africa Cup of Nations title, labelling it “unfair, unprecedented, and unacceptable”... Morocco were