er than the outdoors, largely as a result of poor or impeded airflow.\",\"sentence_key\":\"ca509f040320\",\"sentence_index\":1},{\"text\":\"Researchers mapped 416 HDB flats and surveyed over 1,000 residents during home visits.\",\"subject\":\"researchers\",\"value\":\"mapped 416 HDB flats and surveyed more than 1,000 residents\",\"time\":\"home visits from October 2024 over nine months\",\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.95,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"Exact sample sizes and period are provided in the ST piece and the draft.\",\"importance\":\"core\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"682d3b45819a\",\"draft_sentence\":\"These were some of the findings of nine months of home visits from October 2024, with researchers going to 10 neighbourhoods across the island to map 416 HDB flats and survey more than 1,000 residents.\",\"sentence_key\":\"1115362755ce\",\"sentence_index\":6},{\"text\":\"Around one-third of households were up to 2 deg C warmer than their immediate void decks.\",\"subject\":\"households\",\"value\":\"around one-third up to 2°C warmer than void decks\",\"time\":null,\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.95,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"The draft mirrors the ST article\'s reported distribution of temperature differences.\",\"importance\":\"core\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"b301d95b2845\",\"draft_sentence\":\"Around one-third of the households were up to 2 deg C warmer than their immediate void decks, and around 10 per cent of homes were up to 5 deg C hotter.\",\"sentence_key\":\"93b68aa1e1b5\",\"sentence_index\":3},{\"text\":\"About 10 per cent of homes were up to 5 deg C hotter than outdoors.\",\"subject\":\"homes\",\"value\":\"around 10% up to 5°C hotter\",\"time\":null,\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.95,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"Directly reported in the ST article and reproduced in the draft.\",\"importance\":\"core\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"54a795c7dacb\",\"draft_sentence\":\"Around one-third of the households were up to 2 deg C warmer than their immediate void decks, and around 10 per cent of homes were up to 5 deg C hotter.\",\"sentence_key\":\"93b68aa1e1b5\",\"sentence_index\":3},{\"text\":\"The heat index was used for readings, combining air temperature and humidity to estimate thermal conditions and potential heat stress.\",\"subject\":\"methodology\",\"value\":\"used heat index (temperature + humidity) to estimate thermal conditions\",\"time\":null,\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.9,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"The draft\'s description of the heat index matches the ST article\'s explanation.\",\"importance\":\"minor\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"37fe80ad1bcd\",\"draft_sentence\":\"These readings were based on the heat index, which combines air temperature and humidity to estimate overall thermal conditions and potential heat stress.\",\"sentence_key\":\"33803ebf126e\",\"sentence_index\":4},{\"text\":\"Close to 60 per cent of households had lower airflow than the outdoors, indicating limitations in natural ventilation due to clutter, layouts, closed windows, or building arrangements.\",\"subject\":\"households\",\"value\":\"close to 60% had lower airflow than outdoors due to ventilation impediments\",\"time\":null,\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.9,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"This ventilation finding and listed impediments are explicitly reported in the matched ST article.\",\"importance\":\"core\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"6b67a16727ee\",\"draft_sentence\":\"Close to 60 per cent of the households also had lower airflow than the outdoors, pointing to widespread limitations in natural ventilation when clutter, home layouts, closed windows, or building arrangements impede wind flow.\",\"sentence_key\":\"bbf4d333ca50\",\"sentence_index\":5}],\"claim_summary\":{\"supported\":6,\"weak\":0,\"contradicted\":0,\"total\":6},\"matched_sources\":[{\"name\":\"CNA\",\"title\":\"How heat-proof is your home? Nearly half of over 400 HDB flats are warmer than outdoors: Study\",\"url\":\"https://www.straitstimes.com/singapore/environment/how-heat-proof-is-your-home-nearly-half-of-over-400-hdb-flats-are-warmer-than-outdoors-study\",\"match_type\":\"direct\",\"relevance_note\":\"This ST article is the same piece as the user draft and directly supports the draft\'s core claims (sample size, heat-index differences, ventilation findings, vulnerable groups, study period and institutions).\",\"snippet\":\"A SUTD-led research group found nearly half of more than 400 HDB flats visited were warmer than the outdoors due to poor airflow; 416 flats were mapped and over 1,000 residents surveyed (home visits from Oct 2024).\",\"source_type\":\"article\"}],\"why_not_perfect\":[\"Some context or reporting detail is still missing.\",\"Some wording is still interpretive or less neutral than ideal.\",\"The article can still be clearer in how it connects evidence to conclusions.\",\"Not every important claim is fully or exactly confirmed by the matched CNA/ST sources.\"],\"why_not_perfect_details\":[{\"message\":\"Some context or reporting detail is still missing.\",\"examples\":[]},{\"message\":\"Some wording is still interpretive or less neutral than ideal.\",\"examples\":[]},{\"message\":\"The article can still be clearer in how it connects evidence to conclusions.\",\"examples\":[]},{\"message\":\"Not every important claim is fully or exactly confirmed by the matched CNA/ST sources.\",\"examples\":[]}]}', '2026-05-03 21:25:20', 16, 1, 80, 0, NULL, 0, '2026-03-27 02:40:48', '2026-03-26 10:40:48', '2026-05-03 21:25:20', 'draft', NULL, 0),
