ect\":\"Tan See Leng statement\",\"value\":\"acknowledged worker/business anxiety and committed to taking concerns seriously\",\"time\":\"April 29 (press event)\",\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.85,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"ST reports Tan\'s quoted remarks at the April 29 press event at NTUC Centre.\",\"importance\":\"core\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"4627b1789da1\",\"draft_sentence\":\"“We recognise that there are many workers and businesses that are both anxious and uncertain about what lies ahead,” said Minister for Manpower Tan See Leng during a press event on April 29 held at NTUC Centre.\",\"sentence_key\":\"3066636119fb\",\"sentence_index\":3},{\"text\":\"Dr Tan will co-chair the new Tripartite Jobs Council with NTUC secretary-general Ng Chee Meng and SNEF president Tan Hee Teck; more members and plans will be announced in coming months.\",\"subject\":\"Council leadership and future announcements\",\"value\":\"Dr Tan co-chairs with Ng Chee Meng and Tan Hee Teck; more details forthcoming\",\"time\":\"coming months\",\"match_score\":1,\"confidence\":0.85,\"source\":\"ST\",\"reason\":\"ST names the co-chairs and notes that more members and detailed plans will be announced.\",\"importance\":\"core\",\"status\":\"supported\",\"claim_key\":\"2712f8a2e31b\",\"draft_sentence\":\"Dr Tan will co-chair the new Tripartite Jobs Council with NTUC secretary-general Ng Chee Meng and SNEF president Tan Hee Teck.\",\"sentence_key\":\"8ad120a85af6\",\"sentence_index\":6}],\"claim_summary\":{\"supported\":5,\"weak\":0,\"contradicted\":0,\"total\":5},\"matched_sources\":[{\"name\":\"ST\",\"title\":\"New tripartite council to help workers keep jobs, companies transform amid AI disruption\",\"url\":\"https://www.straitstimes.com/singapore/new-tripartite-council-to-maximise-job-security-help-firms-amid-ai-disruption\",\"match_type\":\"direct\",\"relevance_note\":\"Direct source for the draft: contains the quoted statements, April 29 press event detail, council composition, objectives, and related AI initiatives and statistics cited in the draft.\",\"snippet\":\"SINGAPORE – A new tripartite council will be set up to double down on plans to upskill workers and help companies redesign jobs and adopt new tools, amid a disruption driven by artificial intelligence... Dr Tan will co-chair the new Tripartite Jobs Council with NTUC secretary-general Ng Chee Meng and SNEF president Tan Hee Teck. More members and detailed plans will be announced in the coming months.\",\"source_type\":\"article\"},{\"name\":\"CNA\",\"title\":\"Tan See Leng on use of AI in hiring practices - CNA\",\"url\":\"https://www.channelnewsasia.com/watch/tan-see-leng-use-ai-hiring-practices-4745396\",\"match_type\":\"related\",\"relevance_note\":\"Related background on Manpower Minister Tan See Leng’s comments about AI in employment and tripartite oversight; does not report on the new Tripartite Jobs Council but provides relevant context about government stance on AI and employment practices.\",\"snippet\":\"Manpower Minister Tan See Leng said in Parliament that organisations should follow guidelines on responsible AI use in hiring; TAFEP has not received complaints of AI-related discrimination. Given the pace of AI change, government will continue to monitor and assess guidelines.\",\"source_type\":\"article\"}],\"why_not_perfect\":[\"Source quality is not at the maximum, so the evidence could still be stronger or more directly corroborated.\",\"Some context or reporting detail is still missing.\",\"Some wording is still interpretive or less neutral than ideal.\",\"The article can still be clearer in how it connects evidence to conclusions.\",\"Not every important claim is fully or exactly confirmed by the matched CNA/ST sources.\"],\"why_not_perfect_details\":[{\"message\":\"Source quality is not at the maximum, so the evidence could still be stronger or more directly corroborated.\",\"examples\":[{\"type\":\"source\",\"label\":\"Source example\",\"text\":\"